#   below REGROUP_RATIO, walk toward the nearest visible ally instead of engaging alone.
# - commit: every camp goal is claimed; a goal that is too hard for the group (group_threat * group_hp
#   above health * damage * (1 + allies nearby)) waits for the nearest ally before going in.
